<title>AUSTRIA: Austria sets 20 bln ATS 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Austria sets 20 bln ATS 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Kontrollbank, the Austrian government's financing agent, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Republic of Austria</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 20 bln ATS</p>
<p>MATURITY: 11 April 2007</p>
<p>COUPON: 5.75 pct</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.73658 pct</p>
<p>MAXIMUM YIELD: 5.95 pct</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER: 64.46344 pct</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
